{"id":"entregado","lemma":"entregado","pos":"adj","rank":3316,"glosses":["delivered, submitted","dedicated, devoted"],"ipa":"/entɾeˈɡado/","forms":{"feminine":"entregada","masculinePlural":"entregados","femininePlural":"entregadas"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Has entregado tu informe?","en":"Have you turned in your report?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823785","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"your"},{"g":"shapeless, formless"}]},{"text":"Este paquete fue entregado anoche.","en":"This package was delivered last night.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582631","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"parcel"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"last night"}]},{"text":"¿Cuántos regalos navideños has entregado este año?","en":"How many Christmas presents did you give this year?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300804","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"cuánto"},{"g":"present, gift","l":"regalo"},{"g":"related to Christmas","l":"navideño"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"Ella sugirió que se lo entregada en seguida.","en":"She suggested that I give it to him right away.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to suggest","l":"sugerir"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"often","l":"seguido"}]},{"text":"Los premios serán entregados al final de la competición.","en":"Prizes will be awarded at the end of the contest.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"prize, award","l":"premio"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,null,null,{"g":"competition"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"in the end"],[6,8,"of the"]]}]}